        "prompt": "Review my staged changes, propose a commit message, and commit only after I approve it.",
        "scenario": "Intermediate"
      },
      {
        "title": "Match Project Style",
        "prompt": "Inspect recent commit history, then draft a staged-change commit message that matches this repository's style.",
